OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining    
OL,6,Flargely dry with variable cloud and    
OL,7,Fsome clear spells. Chance of wintry    
OL,8,Fshowers, mainly near coastal parts.    
OL,9,FLight winds allowing some frost and a  
OL,10,Fchance of mist and fog.                
OL,12,CMonday:FOnce any mist or fog clears,   
OL,13,Fanother mainly dry day with variable   
OL,14,Fcloud and some bright or sunny spells. 
OL,15,FRemaining rather cold with generally   
OL,16,Flight winds.                           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
